F][/dim]`<route>_<block_id>.md` — with a `parent` wikilink back to [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]`<route>.md`, a seeded `^prj` lifecycle task, authored child tasks [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]under `## Tasks`, and authored ALL-CAPS sections as `##` headers — [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]from the new `@<route>^<block-id>+` and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]`@<route>:<block-id>+\\[#<pomodoro>]` markers, and Bob Mac Capture [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]highlights and reports the new family correctly.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]capture_project_notes.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/capture_project_notes.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-25[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-25/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Project-note marker grammar[/bold #D7AFFF]                                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]grammar[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]grammar: add the `+` project-note sigil to the `^` and `:` marker [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]families in the shared capture grammar, with a new `CaptureKind`, editor[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]modes, span kind, needs, and diagnostics.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Project-note content renderer[/bold #D7AFFF]                                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]render[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]render: add a pure module that derives the project-note basename and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]renders its frontmatter, `^prj` task, `## Tasks` entries, and ALL-CAPS [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]section headers from a parsed capture item.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Capture execution and JSON contract[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]execute[dim] · [dim][/dim]after grammar, render[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]execute: wire project-note planning into the capture batch planner — [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]parent-note validation, collision rejection, Pomodoro linking on `^prj`,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]marker conflicts, JSON fields, and human output — plus end-to-end CLI [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Capture documentation and help text[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after execute[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs: document the new marker family in the capture guide, `bob capture [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]--help`, and the grammar tables, and cross-reference the projects guide.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bob Mac Capture frontend support[/bold #D7AFFF]                              [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac[dim] · [dim][/dim]after grammar, execute[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac: teach the macOS capture panel the new span kind and capture kind so[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the `+` sigil is highlighted and project-note results are labeled [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]correctly.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-25","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-25.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-ec3f110f3c2de33778925205b6696149","started_at":"2026-09-20T22:27:47.902096+00:00","state":"active"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-25","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-25.1","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-25.2","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-25.3","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-25.4","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-25.5","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-25.land"]}
